                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="w-[234px]">
                        <h4 class="mb-[11px] text-accent text-[38px] leading-[1.2]">04</h4>
                        <p class="mb-4 font-bold uppercase leading-[1.4] text-lg">
                            доставляем<br/>
