                </p>

                <img src="/src/assets/imgs/about/hands.webp" class="max-m576:hidden absolute inset-y-0 h-full -right-[40px]" alt="">
            </div>

            <div class="w-[314px] relative py-[35px] px-[40px] rounded-[60px] bg-white">
                <h4 class="text-lg mb-[78px] leading-[1.4] uppercase font-bold">
                    только<br/>
                    Оригинальна<br/>
                    продукция
